{'symbol': 'CTVA', 'date': '2022-02-25 08:00:00', 'title': 'CORTEVA TO PARTICIPATE IN BANK OF AMERICA SECURITIES 2022 GLOBAL AGRICULTURE AND MATERIALS CONFERENCE', 'text': 'INDIANAPOLIS, FEB. 25, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CORTEVA, INC. (NYSE:\xa0CTVA) ANNOUNCES THAT CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, CHUCK MAGRO, AND CHIEF TECHNOLOGY OFFICER, SAM EATHINGTON, WILL SPEAK AT THE BANK OF AMERICA SECURITIES 2022 GLOBAL AGRICULTURE AND MATERIALS CONFERENCE AT 8:10 A.M. EASTERN TIME ON WEDNESDAY, MARCH 2, 2022.'}